<section class="hero" style="padding:56px 24px 88px;">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,2.8rem)">{{ membershipPage.heading }}</h1>
    <p>{{ membershipPage.intro }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="tier-grid">
    <div class="tier-card">
      <span class="tier-name">EXPLORER · FREE</span>
      <div class="tier-price">$0</div>
      <ul class="tier-list">
        <li>Daily deal alerts by email</li>
        <li>Full access to the public deals feed</li>
        <li>Save deals to a personal wishlist</li>
        <li>Submit deal-hunting enquiries</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/enquiry.html" class="tier-cta">Join Free</a>
    </div>
    <div class="tier-card featured">
      <span class="tier-name">VOYAGER</span>
      <div class="tier-price">$4<span>/month</span></div>
      <ul class="tier-list">
        <li>Everything in Explorer</li>
        <li>Full access to weekly Flash picks</li>
        <li>24-hour early access before deals go public</li>
        <li>No ads on the deals feed</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/enquiry.html" class="tier-cta">Start Voyager</a>
    </div>
    <div class="tier-card">
      <span class="tier-name">GLOBETROTTER</span>
      <div class="tier-price">$12<span>/month</span></div>
      <ul class="tier-list">
        <li>Everything in Voyager</li>
        <li>Top-tier exclusive Flash picks</li>
        <li>Personal deal-hunting requests (priority)</li>
        <li>Direct line to the Mimajo team</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/enquiry.html" class="tier-cta">Start Globetrotter</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p style="max-width:var(--maxw); margin:32px auto 0; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:0.85rem;">
    Tier names, pricing and perks are placeholders for launch — refine these once you know what converts with your audience. Payments aren't wired up yet; see the founder roadmap for the Stripe/PayNow integration step.
  </p>
